4. Important when using search
Because you are using searchCategory and searchCheckList, reset the page to 1 when the search changes. Otherwise, the user might be on page 4, search for something that only has one page of results, and see an empty table.
For example:
onChange={(e) => {
    setSearchCategory(e.target.value);
    setCurrentPage(1);
}}
